      "content": "REST API for accessing UpLead's B2B contact and company database. Supports company search and enrichment, person search and enrichment, combined person-and-company lookup, prospector search for discovering contacts by title or function, email verification, credit balance checking, and list management.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: UpLead Support",
